{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1309,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9693febb999bf1bb91394c26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ドミナントだけじゃ\r\nトラックは成立しねェ。\r\nまずは基本を押さえンぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de1c5b1ee6ce3674de6051fc31a1c4c6f343d382162706810ad6b9d1e82ecdaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36b81f54a947a4e9fd06f359",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "羽があるから速く走れそう…？\r\nハ、単純なヤツ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f30cbf3e7c91de21b9bd20803b334f64ecab7ff7bf3e27bf19ec40dfbb4373a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7cfe45e4e591863b8199dd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呆れるくらい穏やかな顔\r\nしてンなァ…お前にも角が\r\n必要なンじゃねェの？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c486c3a5911b0d3422bf4ba68a28611a3e0d77c00fb1a628c12ffac94e3520ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97206386f798a13ec8db3f91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "オレとの『契約』が続く限り、\r\nお前にゃよく働いてもらう。\r\n…って、言うまでもなかったか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9932b153a4bb54080901ed2fdea2c6558a5bb91f8d6b7eb1c7ef46dd28cefea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:137c41fd1db9f716545c6cf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然让我随性展现只属于我的“逻辑”，\r\n真是个有趣的家伙啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55c1ac10a78dedca3a62ece03423fcc54c2f564a78f7007bea57565802995c5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24af0caee9618cfb12a68e28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "验证完毕。\r\n……直到最后也没有从我身边逃开，真让我惊讶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62ce6018743fb424eb9fb0ff62cf8437c40dc6c8c24465629aa5cb9a595d7c56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff2a03e23c35c0f2ec3dcf99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お前との『契約』…悪くなかったよ。\r\nハハ、愉快な地獄だったなァ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "61177272e8eab3082796d93c81eb8f4fd8c38d086662a3430d5b9666427aaf0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4be6c9e8d666bd7e4104331",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "地獄みてェな道のりだったが、\r\nお互いよく生き残ったな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43c56a65cdeb2b046c7aadffa908a6127c1c25f5c7cd1f938d05c4d6be4ad9e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ed92de46f1c2f44000ac01a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和推算结果一样的成长曲线啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a3a6ed2374043ebad43934b085f813f8ebbe4fc5e453b508ba90719027096fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c31d66c2fa8bd2340c543e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在此之上还有更强的境界，\r\n我可再清楚不过了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "957fde6a1337839db9019e3221e2ed22e838fc8406ee200a81d1f54665b193bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c71570fd65ac6548df693111",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……切。……我是空中神宫。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0110634fefc9e41163072acee7bee65577608dd13bfcfac21bcb803c9da84e6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da74480cb323ebb6268af093",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "理解不了？……正好。\r\n这其中的“逻辑”，就由我来证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33baa39a7a915c09040571511ad7a5eba0b95e28e62898bb3946f9ea00181b8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c9050f60c50b3a527885872",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘁……我来帮忙吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e8981f0496a3f7e4ce573772c16aab94410d704fb7169522e7449caded9de86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8828d4f96a2c81a082d5c7d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的……真没办法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abdccb56b4edc88690978fb1da9d3d67771706f1010073d7aa4e89b94967e61e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4048406a58a869087aadaed1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "魔力アップ。\r\n…って言やァ満足か？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfb690ee0c3972aae32746863851c931cfb0a518c7e6a464df674fc1f383bcf0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6f190d49c4b6447a0d28dd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "悪魔の上っつーと…魔王？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6de742d3be4790085b094177be52f725a170e22594d12df4dceb8d2d7b8036ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a934298d13b796556c39983",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "突き詰めてやる――\r\n地獄の奥の奥までな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff466e90bfbce1a5cd3b8871c4f692e914c0b3c28cd34c80b1d5fed0ff8ffce6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e11857140ba75d39ec741dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…エアシャカール。\r\nオレと『取引』したいって？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7ffa5e0895c5d02646f251b41de7f4f08112da2c6b75780d7bc86e6bb2a18de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21d3bbc540a61d210bcf16db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，时间到了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c87e9eb87deafea0d4cdcac9258220f7746586b3cda302a4cc9fb9f4d2bcc9fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:617d72ee2125b0e57e833cc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完美遵守行程的原因……\r\n因为你让我明白了重要的事情，\r\n真的很谢谢你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "604d793213a3f862f7b55c0748905cc1df51a15fac85cab65b6c72b238ee7981",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9b3932880a94bdf5cdfd592",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793275eb5254d9ee0aa95daa33c90a973bec2e4a987e75c094e5b5d339927bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aec5747b8816d6d9891f2302",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま戻りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6187171daf0cd83405ed28676a1e5578db71985c3568e13f3c699b7bfbf84546",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bee9687810bff2a0583890a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今后我犯错的时候，\r\n希望你能继续指正我。\r\n因为你拥有和我不一样的观点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "831a822cc456fa8dc73c0554b1baba98bb767f4b1f73fa81ff94eb40b9c56e22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adfc4f8d99dda4a277d35f58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……如果是这个方案的话，\r\n我和训练员一定都能同乐吧。\r\n下次……一定要好好邀约才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2a78704dcdcb4092df2d68ba394ab12f1ccb4376a0c7c08d93b233107f3ba33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14a4ea27368143dc5a9cc4e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在德国是没有那么重视过新年的。\r\n所以日本的各种传统礼仪……\r\n真的让我很感兴趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c74baee4169ba416bd4cf89e4c145e21694c91651709cbf774227602e678449a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9981a311323f247de089853f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我赌上蛋糕店女儿的尊严……\r\n今天的Schokolade\r\n一定要做得比平常更好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "744e59869ac2039f9d383e8ba98cd98aeb51ac660ca0265224226d28d667417a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b584d53f80fb81e3ac3700e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完美的料理过程……\r\n加上我敬爱的心意。\r\n请收下我特制的萨赫蛋糕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9a58682d73895597d07ebc0e99c01e6add3f8dc518d478457fbe2c65590a7c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0481b3a67fc6b764fe35fe2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有关七夕的事情都是飞鹰教我的。\r\n我的愿望……\r\n是希望能直线朝目标前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91f103e72ef3d2b4e7c742cdaedf5fa6b1bf2a566ef5ee392f7d9f4da3878589",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16b36a008614520ee44316e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然今天是万圣节，\r\n但我想应该不会有人对我恶作剧吧。\r\n毕竟我都已经准备好糖果点心了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb9380edf689a9957dfa2903187175bf1d6818a1e8a07425916e55461f3a5eff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2260c32767425cc951d639b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我从以前就很喜欢圣诞节。\r\n因为所有客人买了父亲做的蛋糕，\r\n都会笑得很开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26eaee5452d055e883faa20aa6e8679f77bb3d7ae49ce6b5535f91ec724f888e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9026bed3e52dd3fdf5ec163",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果你不介意的话，我今天\r\n想要占用一下你的时间。……因为\r\n今天是和重要的人一起过的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ee409963983ca50ce80847f41ba37b45b1ac011dd1a7ef269decb52072a937f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d48b07864d6d509ad5c23eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "顺利达成目标了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "606ce0d2ff04d5313ab01e09b4070a656e57ebe24bc4c4483da264f180241384",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc81e10fc18fe2d5df61fad5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的故乡会在年底的时候，\r\n办一个盛大的派对来迎新年。\r\nGuten Rutsch……祝你有好的一年。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e5447edd8382353fcaa72303143f0edc4b185c2fd1e504a4f1cc40e085d1be5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:922e0401ef9d8444614eb695",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐。\r\n食堂有美味的蛋糕，\r\n不介意的话稍后请和我一起去吃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "badd1e2972f70f49cdf51904af55fbc9a5a1ff5cd7d48669e0e498c072b988eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5fd6a4b9bfe93e0d14bc6bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我向爸妈要到了特制食谱。\r\n你可以好好地期待你的生日蛋糕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dbac5b6106175d15aa1de1ae935c2c2beda70dbac019cce91021e88bbc53851",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:963f4dfe64292df1fd63bcef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自己诞生的日子……\r\n也是重新审视\r\n自己人生安排的重要日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a71cd374dd3ea55258f3284d433513219f8f005bfeb89824bae875b3b3d195b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:662c8816f81dac439c0e5cc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日当天我会比平常更想念父母……\r\n希望自己能一直都是\r\n让他们感到骄傲的女儿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4f9bb644f8f9621aadc97517f8c3d886aa812d421a34c7da5d1baa620e7b392",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82f84941ebab2998661a1184",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到了给你的新通知喔。\r\n为了确定今后的行程，\r\n要在忘记之前确认喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e20428b1e4e5948a2885171754466dfdc24b42cd9cb8520559b25a6842852b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a18e92ca69c1a24bb7bdaba9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有你的Geschenk……礼物。\r\n里面装的会是什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "02007735f5d3b9df8a2a007ece80deb10d8bcbfaf9fadece2bbf021e40727956",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8db103ed3692ea1d4410afe7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "依照计划完成了任务……\r\n真了不起。\r\n记得领取努力达成的奖励喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b88aca81506c5860862c8468232602d02394be80ef8e063467f580041f05644e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c0e898271211733e6f40a81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很快就要举办活动了。\r\n为了当天能够尽兴，\r\n要好好制定行程才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c22675691d628092edd160141768df4e3918192e01c373049534389088eb56bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41bb7fbd9f4cd5818d7a444a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在举办活动呢。\r\n活动就像是嘉年华一样……\r\n感觉身体蠢蠢欲动呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5c70d287d4c5510ab6397e272092ee37d00be90c2917898f6b715bc019fb118",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98301da42c67775b3b517dec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我的失误……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f99d6fd6144b861415e5439850e1200c2d17e5890c98cab2cb9cf110993c349",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:627ab363e57719578e9c409f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级好像提升了。\r\n请确认。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17b6d060df96efebce0e6e082e8d0d5a17bf2da1242c6ff2d6d5cb9ed9d51e8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b197e0fe850c586979ea19b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着やすさ、運動性、上品さ…\r\nそれら全てをバランスよく汲んだ物\r\n――それがこの服というわけです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f60e0b47767ea106796d55890a2c6e73bddf9ff2a7275b4d1672e00874074459",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a4e190fccf99441d34d45f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ジャケットはクリーニング。\r\nベルトは手洗い…洗濯の時間をより\r\n効率的にできないものでしょうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "444ad66c28e01c769363088dd4749db5d27335850e286a50f2d7198e50fd64c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5cdf575660fb3fe9a955f6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いいですか。ボタンを下まで止めて\r\nいないのはファッションです。\r\nだらしがないわけではありません。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2808c759f6930f5b11aa9d34810b7cfdace1b5d5c94d378dd31f2ca16038df71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c54395c0d9b433546c5aa7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我想得太天真了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac13e729e4e027b88e5491113bd00ebb2af4ba842ef226925aa7dc925f0b166c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afdaca90db6979538339087b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "按照计划取得胜利了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a752a751a2a613fc2c1e297963c6daff42b9cad3c7ddfc8de2301773029ba80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c9476b27749eb12bb32165d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我的失误……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f99d6fd6144b861415e5439850e1200c2d17e5890c98cab2cb9cf110993c349",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fffaa3dd23def257e786423",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我想得太天真了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac13e729e4e027b88e5491113bd00ebb2af4ba842ef226925aa7dc925f0b166c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0692f502135f3be6e5a6de3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要比原订目标走得更远……",
      "source_fingerprint": "274f1cc04eaddbcb45f4b523ac66995dcdf93e4fcb32ffac64eb1b2f95075e7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
